==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[emphatick]] {{qualifier|obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|ἐμφατικός||emphatic|tr=emphatikos|lang=grc}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|lang=grc|ἔμφασις|tr=emphasis}} (English {{term|emphasis|lang=en}}), from {{term|ἐμφαίνω||I show, present|tr=emphainō|lang=grc}}, from {{term|ἐν||in|tr=en|lang=grc}} + {{term|φαίνω||I shine, show|tr=phainō|lang=grc}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɪmˈfætɪk/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ætɪk|lang=en}}

